# Pairs with NoResurrectionAfterClear. The gate alone only orders the write after the clear; the latch is what refuses it.
MODULE: FlushSkipsClearRecheck
TARGET: NoResurrectionAfterClear
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a flush that waited on the gate does not re-check the clear latch
PERTURBS: BeginFlush

--- FIND
    /\ gate = "free"
    /\ ~cleared
    /\ gate' = "flush"
--- REPLACE
    /\ gate = "free"
    \* MUTATION: the clear latch is not re-checked
    /\ gate' = "flush"
--- END
